{
  "repo": "HYDRA-UMC-BRIDGE-DROIDS",
  "ecosystem": "hydra",
  "tagline": "A cell job becomes a named droid action, never raw motion, once the shared gate says yes.",
  "description": "HYDRA-UMC-BRIDGE-DROIDS maps a correlated cell job onto a named action trigger of a legged or humanoid droid, checks it against the platform profile, asks the shared evaluate_job gate of HYDRA-UMC-SDK and, for a Boston Dynamics Spot, sends the accepted action through bosdyn-client. It never takes the lease and never powers the motors.",
